WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
CodeVerse keeps code, execution, review, and recovery context together.

00:05.500 --> 00:16.000
Try a working anonymous workspace before creating an account.

00:16.000 --> 00:28.000
Run the included C++ project and inspect its output in place.

00:28.000 --> 00:44.000
Build and recalculate an interactive preview from the same workspace.

00:44.000 --> 00:56.000
Open the full editor while collaboration roles and context stay visible.

00:56.000 --> 01:10.000
EvidenceOS connects changes to review, execution, replay, and recovery.

01:10.000 --> 01:16.000
MIT licensed. Feature-frozen. Open for reliability and contributor experience.
